"Hibok-Hibok":{tl:[["1871","Nearby Mt. Vulcan erupts and sinks a cemetery"],["1948–53","Series of eruptions"],["1951","Pyroclastic flows kill about 500"]],hz:"Pyroclastic flows from collapsing lava domes, lahars and ashfall.",dy:"Camiguin's hot springs and the Sunken Cemetery are volcanic legacies."},
Didicas:{tl:[["1952","New island rises from the sea"],["1969","Second eruption"],["1978","Eruption adds to the island"]],hz:"Island and submarine eruptions can cause steam blasts and waves."},
